  "critical": false,
  "description": "Reactor irradiation of target nuclides and chemical separation of the resulting radioisotopes. Produces the Pu-238, Sr-90, Am-241, Co-60, and Cs-137 sources that fuel every radioisotope power system. Requires hot cells with metre-scale shielding, remote manipulators, and solvent-extraction chemistry (PUREX and variants).",
